Session 2: Keeping children engaged
Children learn best during activities that
are fun, positive and full of praise
Key message 2
You can help make activities fun and positive by:
• speaking to your child in a positive and kind tone of voice;
• relaxing and celebrating your child’s skills, attempts
and appropriate behaviour;
• being physically gentle;
• showing affection;
• praising your child.
